:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Yuma Kuga & Doge]].''
'''Yuma Kuga & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by beating any stage in [[World Trigger Collaboration Event#Battle! Tamakoma Second's Ace|Battle! Tamakoma Second's Ace]] during the [[World Trigger Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 678
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Yuma Kuga & Cat
|name2 = Yuma Kuga & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Yuma Kuga & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is similar to [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman]], except with a much longer cooldown. This is an enormous drawback, since Cameraman's main strength is her massive DPS when stacked.

Yuma Kuga can be useful in the early game due to a lack of anti-Traitless options, and since unlike Cameraman, there's no requirement to invest in a [[True Form]].

